#: {{ux|nb|'''vise''' fram til vennene våre|show to our friends}}
# to send someone on their way
#: {{ux|nb|'''vise''' noen til en dyktig lege|send someone to a proficient physician}}
#: {{ux|nb|'''vise''' bort|turn away}}

